From 755057b41e8b077244d82e5a490885f4829cde00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rawdanger-recomp <rawdanger-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:46:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rawdanger-recomp: v0.8.0 menus, pop-ups, keys on screen,
 mouse look fixes

- Options words of the background picture show with the Japanese look (fall back to the ordinary picture)
- Original PS2 Post Processing Filter: the renamed, inverted switch (old section still understood)
- F1 menu: the game's Options screen look by default; bigger achievements page; Display tab shows Back again
- Pop-up size (small / normal / large / huge) for achievements, notes and the keys list
- Keys on screen (F10): the player's keys at the left while playing
- Direct mouse look: unread time counted in console frames, not window passes (no flip-flop to the stick at high refresh
  rates or hitches)
- Walk speed step 6 runs (the walk keys hold Cross while playing)
- The game's texts show key caps or the controller's symbols, by the input last used
- Texture overrides: kept pictures of the other look are forgotten when the override space is reused (garbled sprites)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
